      "role": "user",
      "content": "thanks. we're also dealing with some weird stuff in the aisles. sometimes it feels like a pallet will be perfectly fine one minute, then suddenly it's slightly shifted or leaning the next, even though nobody was near it. is there something about the vibrations or the floor surface that causes that kind of unpredictable movement?",
